id=oppocam_samurai
name=OppoCamera (stock RealmeUI F.14) for Android 17
version=v0.11.2
versionCode=16
author=Mashrur (with Claude)
description=Stock Realme X2 Pro camera on Infinity-X A17. Photo, 16MP front, 64MP, night, portrait, filters, pano, macro, slow-mo, video with EIS and Ultra Steady. Smooth 960 (real interpolated frames, about 35 s) with progress screen, shutter ring and Mods settings (Settings > Mods): interpolation, denoise, deflicker, pause viewfinder, Clean video. Known issues: occasional HAL crash on mode switch, beauty face-shaping.
